  "question": {
    "text": "The students <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math> are to be divided into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> groups <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> such that each group has at least one student and the group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> has at most <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> students. Then the total number of possibilities of forming such groups is __________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "31650",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> has one student then number of groups</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5100</mn></math></p><p>If group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> has two students then number of groups</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11430</mn></math></p><p>If group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> has three students then number of groups</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>10</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15120</mn></math></p><p>So total groups<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>31650</mn></math></p>",
